{"p":123,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, that's right."},{"p":123,"b":10,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"He was with Horace, I understand."},{"p":123,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"He was with Horace."},{"p":123,"b":12,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"But was Ray still sort of, you know, the showman that he was later with Ellington, you know?"},{"p":123,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, he started out with us."},{"p":123,"b":14,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"After he had his own little band?"},{"p":123,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah. Dancing and singing, and everything."},{"p":123,"b":16,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Did he play much fiddle with Earl?"},{"p":123,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Uh-huh."}]}